# The `f3d` reduction of set (e): data, part 5 (generated data)

Data of the label-split certificate reducing the projected combination `Y - (d - 1)² T₁` of the set
(e) vertex diagrams of self-energy topology `f3d` to its Kira masters: the constants (merged
template, factors of the common denominator `q`, evaluation point `x₀`), the target, the masters and
master list of the checker, and blocks of seeds `(i, j, c, sc, w, len, n, e, a)` (see
`QED.Algebra.IBPCert.Sector.GSeed`) with their checks `QED.Algebra.IBPCert.Sector.GBlock.ok`. From
an untrusted elimination over finite fields and rational reconstruction.

Generated by `gen.py` (offline cache `setecert/fams`); do not edit. Integers are written as `.ofNat
n` and `.negSucc n` (`= -n - 1`).
